    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2FVLrqu7REJ6EYUbr4JythQ)_\n\n## What\n\n- Catches the changelogs up after the last tidy (#328, 2026-11-08); the nightly run missed the days since.\n- Adds merged PRs #329 to #388 (all 60) and the direct commits on main since then (merge commits left out).\n- Emacs changelog (`emacs-modular/.config/emacs-modular/CHANGELOG.org`):\n  - new sets: \"Literature notes filled from BibTeX\", \"Book and collection tables\", \"Batch reports for the lint and convert commands\", \"See also footnotes (`sp-see-also`)\".\n  - new lines in the Search, Note tags, BibTeX and academic tools, DEVONthink, Author and literature note lint, Notes vault tools and Module docs sets, with their date ranges updated.\n  - \"Being developed\": date updated, DEVONthink bullet extended, two new bullets for merged-but-untried work (labelled `needs-further-testing`).\n- Global changelog (`CHANGELOG.org`), non-Emacs changes: `devonthink-open` (#379, #382, #384 and four direct commits), `gh-pr-pdf` and `dotfiles-prs` (#340, #341, #349, #350 and one direct commit), the emoji standard (#385), and a `btop.conf` line.\n\n## Update (2026-11-12)\n\n- #326 and #327 (grouped backlinks sidebar and widget) reached `main` as #390 and #392.\n- Their \"Grouped backlinks\" bullet is removed from \"Being developed\", and both are now lines in the \"Links in notes\" set, after #325.\n- Main is merged into the branch.\n\n## Left as it was\n\n- PR #349 had no attribution marker, so it is credited to Sia.\n\n## Not checked\n\n- Summaries come from the PR bodies, commit messages and file lists; nothing was run.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiD1EqErxv8Y1wG33ZF",
